			"color": "6",
			"text": "# Cards\nCards render *markdown*: **intense**, /italic/, ==highlight==, `code`,\nreal math $e^{i\\pi} + 1 = 0$,\n- [x] task lists\n- [ ] with checkboxes\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> Alerts work too \u2014 cards are rendered by the engine itself.\n\nDouble-click to edit the raw text; [[Canvas]] links work when the card is engaged."
